 "caveat": "The two lines part by under a day across thirty years, inside a year-to-year scatter of several days. That is the honest size of the signal: the attribution is of the *trend*, not of any single year, and no year's date can be called human-caused. The counterfactual also inherits every limit of the response function it is built on: it attributes the warming the animals tracked, not the animals.",
